C0012.description:
In `build_feedback_records`, the near-duplicate handling loop (step 3, approx line 260) iterates `duplicate_pairs` as `(fid_a, fid_b, sim)` but only annotates `fid_a` with a duplicate record. `fid_b` receives no feedback about the duplication.

Evidence — the loop body:
for fid_a, fid_b, sim in duplicate_pairs:
